# Hash-bound receipts are reproduced byte-for-byte in CI. Enforce LF checkouts
# so file-byte SHA-256 identities are identical on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.pt binary
*.gz binary
# Preserve the owner's original attachment bytes, including mixed line endings.
research/hitchhiker/USER_ARCHITECTURAL_PROPOSAL.md -text whitespace=cr-at-eol
